text: ['Hangarback Walker enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\\nWhen Hangarback Walker dies, create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying for each +1/+1 counter on Hangarback Walker.\\n{1}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Hangarback Walker.', 'You have no maximum hand size.\\n{T}: Add {C}.']
flavor: ['"The tower isn\'t the structure itself. It is all of us, and the wisdom we share. It grows ever upward, a stone for every new arrival."\\n—Archmage Vintra']
